1. copy the database, so if it crashes we still have backup: cp data/drhajar.db data/database_backup_before_cascade.db
2. check if the backup is there: ls -lh data/
3. run migrate_cascade.py
4. enter the database sqlite3 data/drhajar.db
5. run this: PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON;
6. run these: PRAGMA foreign_key_list(consultations);
    PRAGMA foreign_key_list(grossesses);
    PRAGMA foreign_key_list(suivi_grossesse);
    PRAGMA foreign_key_list(rendez_vous);
    PRAGMA foreign_key_list(documents);
    PRAGMA foreign_key_list(ordonnance_lignes);
    PRAGMA foreign_key_list(demande_examen_lignes);
7.  now delete the test patient and see if all its data deleted 